{57}{Of what importance is Saint Mannox?}{}{5}{}{59}{}
{59}{Saint Mannox was a very, very holy man.  There are many miracles attributed to him, and most of them are well-documented.  There's a talisman associated with him at the offices of archaeology, if you're interested in that sort of thing...}{Saint Mannox was a very, very holy man.  There are many miracles attributed to him, and most of them are well-documented.  There's a talisman associated with him at the offices of archaeology, if you're interested in that sort of thing...}{}{}{}{}
