{104}{Nasrudin was an ardent believer in elven philosophy.  Elves feel that everyone and everything have their rightful place in the world...that this reality is formed through the combined experience of all forms of life.  Good and evil rarely play a part in how elves view the world...}{Nasrudin was an ardent believer in elven philosophy.  Elves feel that everyone and everything have their rightful place in the world...that this reality is formed through the combined experience of all forms of life.  Good and evil rarely play a part in how elves view the world...}{}{}{}{}
