{111}{Evil, in the most basic terms, might be described as something which disallows the progression of the natural order.  I suppose it's a gray area, but you might say evil is anything diametrically opposed to elven philosophy...}{Evil, in the most basic terms, might be described as something which disallows the progression of the natural order.  I suppose it's a gray area, but you might say evil is anything diametrically opposed to elven philosophy...}{}{}{}{}
{112}{To which, I might say...even THOSE things have their place...}{}{5}{}{114}{}
{114}{[Alexander smiles.]  It's said that single elven philosophical debates have spanned literal decades.  You can see why...}{[Alexander smiles.]  It's said that single elven philosophical debates have spanned literal decades.  You can see why...}{}{}{}{}
