{122}{I've discussed at length the Stone and the Shape...}{}{5}{}{124}{}
{124}{[He gives you an appraising look, obviously impressed.]  Not many outlanders can speak of these things...tell me, my friend, what do you see as the major difference between the two...?}{[He gives you an appraising look, obviously impressed.]  Not many outlanders can speak of these things...tell me, my friend, what do you see as the major difference between the two...?}{}{}{}{}
