{165}{Nasrudin was a very powerful and wise elf who lived during the Age of Legends.  As the leader of the Elven Council, Nasrudin was both the physical and spiritual leader of all the lands of Arcanum.  For 1000 years he ruled over the council, and the land prospered, and all was well...}{Nasrudin was a very powerful and wise elf who lived during the Age of Legends.  As the leader of the Elven Council, Nasrudin was both the physical and spiritual leader of all the lands of Arcanum.  For 1000 years he ruled over the council, and the land prospered, and all was well...}{}{}{}{}
