{172}{The coming of Arronax heralded the end of an age for Arcanum--from the disbanding of the Elven Council to the death of our beloved Nasrudin...}{The coming of Arronax heralded the end of an age for Arcanum--from the disbanding of the Elven Council to the death of our beloved Nasrudin...}{}{}{}{}
