{182}{Nasrudin died after he and the council banished Arronax at the Ring of Brodgar.  Nasrudin was wounded mortally in the battle which preceded the banishment, and died not long after...}{Nasrudin died after he and the council banished Arronax at the Ring of Brodgar.  Nasrudin was wounded mortally in the battle which preceded the banishment, and died not long after...}{}{}{}{}
