{189}{According to the Archaeon, "...Nasrudin traveled to the southernmost tip of the land, and there laid himself to rest."  That is why we are here...this temple is built over his remains...}{According to the Archaeon, "...Nasrudin traveled to the southernmost tip of the land, and there laid himself to rest."  That is why we are here...this temple is built over his remains...}{}{}{}{gf2021 1}
{190}{Oh, really?  And where might I find these remains?}{}{5}{}{195}{}
