{195}{The remains of Nasrudin are just below us, in the lower catacombs.  There is a stairway, through the doors behind me.  It leads down to the burial chamber and the sarcophagus in which he is encased.  Unfortunately, only church elders and pilgrims are allowed to see the remains...}{The remains of Nasrudin are just below us, in the lower catacombs.  There is a stairway, through the doors behind me.  It leads down to the burial chamber and the sarcophagus in which he is encased.  Unfortunately, only church elders and pilgrims are allowed to see the remains...}{}{}{}{ru 2059}
