{208}{Arronax was an elf on the original Elven Council, during the Age of Legends.  According to the histories,  Arronax was a very evil elf...he had personal interests in gaining control of the council and using it for his own, dark ends.  Arronax thought that not only should elves rule, but that they should subjugate the other races.  Nasrudin came to our defense...}{Arronax was an elf on the original Elven Council, during the Age of Legends.  According to the histories,  Arronax was a very evil elf...he had personal interests in gaining control of the council and using it for his own, dark ends.  Arronax thought that not only should elves rule, but that they should subjugate the other races.  Nasrudin came to our defense...}{}{}{}{}
{209}{Where is he now?}{}{5}{lf3 0}{216}{lf3 1}
