{216}{Arronax was banished by Nasrudin and the Council after a large battle near the Ring of Brodgar.  Arronax had waged war against the council...it is speculated that he had tried to wrest control of the council from Nasrudin for his own purposes.  Nasrudin died from wounds he received in that battle...}{Arronax was banished by Nasrudin and the Council after a large battle near the Ring of Brodgar.  Arronax had waged war against the council...it is speculated that he had tried to wrest control of the council from Nasrudin for his own purposes.  Nasrudin died from wounds he received in that battle...}{}{}{}{}
{217}{You say he was 'banished'--what does that mean?}{}{5}{}{221}{}
{218}{A few more questions about Arronax...}{}{5}{}{423}{}
{219}{A few more general questions about the Panarii...}{}{5}{}{48}{}
