{221}{When someone is banished, they are sent to what is known as the Void...}{When someone is banished, they are sent to what is known as the Void...}{}{}{}{}
{222}{And the Void?  What is it?}{}{5}{}{224}{}
{224}{Well, my friend, that is an area of some debate.  Many say that the Void is an actual place...a plane of existence where the evil pay for their transgressions for all of eternity.  Others say that the Void is merely a state of unbeing...not a physical place.  What is known is that when someone is banished they are no longer here...and they cannot come back...}{Well, my friend, that is an area of some debate.  Many say that the Void is an actual place...a plane of existence where the evil pay for their transgressions for all of eternity.  Others say that the Void is merely a state of unbeing...not an actual place.  What is known is that when someone is banished they are no longer here...and they cannot come back...}{}{}{}{}
{225}{How is that any different from death?}{}{5}{}{230}{}
{226}{I happen to know that some DO come back from the Void...}{}{5}{gf1096}{236}{}
{227}{What of the prophecy that Arronax will return?}{}{5}{lf6 1}{246}{}
{228}{Has anyone else ever been banished?}{}{5}{}{431}{}
{229}{A few more questions about Arronax...}{}{5}{}{423}{}
{230}{Death, as proven through magick, is sometimes a temporary state--entities can be resurrected.  There is no "resurrection" from the Void.  Banishment was a permanent solution, a punishment of the highest degree.  It's never done anymore.  There are those who believe the knowledge of how to do so has been lost forever...}{Death, as proven through magick, is sometimes a temporary state--entities can be resurrected.  There is no "resurrection" from the Void.  Banishment was a permanent solution, a punishment of the highest degree.  It's never done anymore.  There are those who believe the knowledge of how to do so has been lost forever...}{}{}{}{lf7 1}
{231}{I happen to know that some DO come back from the Void...}{}{5}{gf1096 1, lf9 0}{236}{lf9 1}
{232}{What of the prophecy that Arronax will return?}{}{5}{lf6 1}{246}{}
{233}{A few more questions about Arronax...}{}{5}{}{423}{}
