{282}{So you're telling me you were the sole survivor in the crash of the IFS Zephyr?}{So you're telling me you were the sole survivor in the crash of the IFS Zephyr?}{}{}{}{}
{283}{Yes.}{}{5}{}{292}{lf8 1}
{284}{Uh, no...}{}{5}{}{287}{}
{285}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{287}{[Alexander looks at you strangely.]  I see.  Well, is there anything else I can help you with?}{[Alexander looks at you strangely.]  I see.  Well, is there anything else I can help you with?}{}{}{}{}
