{292}{Do you have any idea what that means?  It's you!  You're the Living One!  It's a miracle...!}{Do you have any idea what that means?  It's you!  You're the Living One!  It's a miracle...!}{}{}{}{}
{293}{Let's not blow this out of proportion...}{}{5}{}{295}{}
{295}{Out of proportion?  This is an astronomical event!  The return of Nasrudin!  The final battle!  The end of all we know, and a new beginning!  The most amazing...!}{Out of proportion?  This is an astronomical event!  The return of Nasrudin!  The final battle!  The end of all we know, and a new beginning!  The most amazing...!}{}{}{}{}
{296}{Fine!  I'm the Living One!  Do as I say, and shut up...!}{}{5}{}{298}{}
{298}{Of course, of course...[He composes himself, but just barely.]  Forgive my excitement, exalted one.  We have waited for you for a long time...}{Of course, of course...[He composes himself, but just barely.]  Forgive my excitement, exalted one.  We have waited for you for a long time...}{}{}{}{}
{299}{Let's keep this between us..}{}{5}{}{301}{}
{301}{Of course!  But you must listen to me...we were warned by the high priest to expect your arrival.  And he told us to scorn you as an imposter.  For some reason, he refuses to believe...}{Of course!  But you must listen to me...we were warned by the high priest to expect your arrival.  And he told us to scorn you as an imposter.  For some reason, he refuses to believe...}{}{}{}{ru 2061}
{302}{I can understand his position...the whole thing is a bit odd...}{}{5}{}{304}{}
{304}{[Alexander laughs.]  There are times when all of us find it difficult to follow the path chosen for us.  In the end...does it really matter if you were or you weren't?  You seem intent on discovering what has happened, and already you and Arronax have crossed paths.  If you thwart his plan, you will have played the ROLE of the Living One.  Is there any difference in the end?}{[Alexander laughs.]  There are times when all of us find it difficult to follow the path chosen for us.  In the end...does it really matter if you were or you weren't?  You seem intent on discovering what has happened, and already you and Arronax have crossed paths.  If you thwart his plan, you will have played the ROLE of the Living One.  Is there any difference in the end?}{}{}{}{}
{305}{I suppose not.  I just wish people would stop trying to kill me.}{}{5}{}{307}{}
{307}{I'm not worried.  You've come this far...regardless of what you think, I feel that fate has chosen a worthy champion.  Now, how can I be of further service?}{I'm not worried.  You've come this far...regardless of what you think, I feel that fate has chosen a worthy champion.  Now, how can I be of further service?}{}{}{}{}
{308}{Yes...what can I expect from people around here?}{}{5}{}{310}{}
{310}{You should be very careful about who you reveal yourself to.  If you speak with Hadrian the archaeologist, you may not want to tell him--he's a great man of faith, but he is old; belief in you will come slowly.   Gunther Willhelm is a brilliant man, and open to new ideas...I believe he will accept you immediately...}{You should be very careful about who you reveal yourself to.  If you speak with Hadrian the archaeologist, you may not want to tell him--he's a great man of faith, but he is old; belief in you will come slowly.   Gunther Willhelm is a brilliant man, and open to new ideas...I believe he will accept you immediately...}{}{}{}{ru 2062}
{311}{Thank you.  I remember that.  A few more questions?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
