{348}{[Alexander's fists clench when you tell him of Mannox.  You can see that he's just barely controlling his rage.]  I see.  If you find out what all of this means, return to me.  If indeed my fam...I mean, the blood of Mannox was spilled for some darker plot, you can be assured that there will be retribution.  I swear it by my life.  Was there anything else?}{[Alexander's fists clench when you tell him of Mannox.  You can see that he's just barely controlling his rage.]  I see.  If you find out what all of this means, return to me.  If indeed my fam...I mean, the blood of Mannox was spilled for some darker plot, you can be assured that there will be retribution.  I swear it by my life.  Was there anything else?}{}{}{}{}
