{354}{It seems like we've all been deceived my friend.  It seems your path no longer lies with us.  But if you have the time, perhaps you could look into the message that was written on the inside of the crypt....return to me if you find what it means.  Otherwise, good luck to you.  I hope you find the final resting place of Nasrudin...}{It seems like we've all been deceived my friend.  It seems your path no longer lies with us.  But if you have the time, perhaps you could look into the message that was written on the inside of the crypt....return to me if you find what it means.  Otherwise, good luck to you.  I hope you find the final resting place of Nasrudin...}{}{}{}{}
