{361}{[Alexander is silent for a long time.  Then...]  It seems we, the Panarii, have an important responsibility.  Many of your troubles, Living One, were born because we allowed ourselves to be deceived for so many years.  That will be no longer.  And it seems that my family has been deceived and dishonored.  I think I know  to whom I must speak about this.  [He looks in the direction of the high priest's chambers.]}{[Alexander is silent for a long time.  Then...]  It seems we, the Panarii, have an important responsibility.  Many of your troubles, Living One, were born because we allowed ourselves to be deceived for so many years.  That will be no longer.  And it seems that my family has been deceived and dishonored.  I think I know  to whom I must speak about this.  [He looks in the direction of the high priest's chambers.]}{}{}{}{ru 2066, fp}
