{385}{Oh!  It's you!  You've finally come!  The blimp crash survivor!  I saw your picture in the Tarantian!  I am Alexander...First Acolyte of the Temple!  It's a great pleasure to meet you!}{Oh!  It's you!  You've finally come!  The blimp crash survivor!  I saw your picture in the Tarantian!  I am Alexander...First Acolyte of the Temple!  It's a great pleasure to meet you!}{}{}{}{lf12 1, lf1 1}
