{407}{How should I go about doing that?}{}{5}{}{409}{}
{409}{There are many scholars here who are well-versed in the history of the Panarii...speak with them.  And you said the high priest told you that his secret lies with Nasrudin...perhaps you should find out what you can about Nasrudin's remains.  Hadrian the archaeologist is the expert on such things.  And I can answer any general questions you have about our religion...}{There are many scholars here who are well-versed in the history of the Panarii...speak with them.  And you said the high priest told you that his secret lies with Nasrudin...perhaps you should find out what you can about Nasrudin's remains.  Hadrian the archaeologist is the expert on such things.  And I can answer any general questions you have about our religion...}{}{}{}{}
