{458}{Kraka-tur was a conniving, twisted monster, half-man and half-dragon, who terrorized cities and villages, killing their inhabitants and burning them to the ground.  With the strength of a dragon, but the dark heart of basest man, he was evil beyond comparison.  After a colossal battle, he was subdued and banished.  In the struggle, he lost an eye, which is on display in the offices of archaeology if you're interested.}{Kraka-tur was a conniving, twisted monster, half-man and half-dragon, who terrorized cities and villages, killing their inhabitants and burning them to the ground.  With the strength of a dragon, but the dark heart of basest man, he was evil beyond comparison.  After a colossal battle, he was subdued and banished.  In the struggle, he lost an eye, which is on display in the offices of archaeology if you're interested.}{}{}{}{ru 2115}
