{480}{I am Alexander, High Acolyte here in the First Panarii Temple. [The man before is tall and broad, with chiseled, planar features, a heavy brow and kind eyes.  His hands are huge, and heavily callused--beneath his robes, scarred forearms like those of a warrior.]}{I am Alexander, High Acolyte here in the First Panarii Temple. [The man before is tall and broad, with chiseled, planar features, a heavy brow and kind eyes.  His hands are huge, and heavily callused--beneath his robes, scarred forearms like those of a warrior.]}{}{}{}{}
