{500}{Where remains?}{}{-4}{}{514}{lf18 1}
{514}{The remains of Nasrudin are just below us, in the lower catacombs.  There is a stairway, [further down this hall and to the left.]  There you will find entrance to the burial chamber.  There are guards there who can show you...}{The remains of Nasrudin are just below us, in the lower catacombs.  There is a stairway, [further down this hall and to the left.]  There you will find entrance to the burial chamber.  There are guards there who can show you...}{}{}{}{ru 2059}
{515}{Uh...okay.  Downstairs!  Can I see?}{}{-4}{}{519}{}
