{543}{Nasrudin was a great elf--the leader of the Elven Council during the Age of Legends.  He was very wise and very powerful.  He ruled all of Arcanum during the Age of Legends...}{Nasrudin was a great elf--the leader of the Elven Council during the Age of Legends.  He was very wise and very powerful.  He ruled all of Arcanum during the Age of Legends...}{}{}{}{}
