{550}{He died in battle with a very evil elf named Arronax.  Arronax wanted to hurt the other races--dwarves, humans, gnomes, ogres, halflings--and Nasrudin came to our rescue.  Nasrudin banished Arronax, but he was hurt in the fight and died a little while later...}{He died in battle with a very evil elf named Arronax.  Arronax wanted to hurt the other races--dwarves, humans, gnomes, ogres, halflings--and Nasrudin came to our rescue.  Nasrudin banished Arronax, but he was hurt in the fight and died a little while later...}{}{}{}{}
