{552}{What Age of Lejunds?}{}{-4}{}{562}{}
{553}{More Nasrudin!}{}{-4}{}{536}{}
{554}{Church questions!}{}{-4}{}{529}{}
{556}{The Elven Council was a group of powerful mages who oversaw the well-being of Arcanum during the Age of Legends.  They were disbanded soon after the banishment of Arronax...}{The Elven Council was a group of powerful mages who oversaw the well-being of Arcanum during the Age of Legends.  They were disbanded soon after the banishment of Arronax...}{}{}{}{}
{557}{What Age of Lejunds?}{}{-4}{}{562}{}
