{562}{The Age of Legends was a long time ago.  It was a time of heroes and magick and monsters and adventure.  You would like the stories from that time, my simple friend.  They are wonderful and exciting and sometimes scary...}{The Age of Legends was a long time ago.  It was a time of heroes and magick and monsters and adventure.  You would like the stories from that time, my simple friend.  They are wonderful and exciting and sometimes scary...}{}{}{}{}
