{575}{Arronax was an evil, powerful elf who opposed Nasrudin.  He wanted to hurt the other people of Arcanum...he only liked elves, and no one else.  He raised an army to fight, and Nasrudin came to our defense.  There was a big fight, and Arronax was banished.}{Arronax was an evil, powerful elf who opposed Nasrudin.  He wanted to hurt the other people of Arcanum...he only liked elves, and no one else.  He raised an army to fight, and Nasrudin came to our defense.  There was a big fight, and Arronax was banished.}{}{}{}{}
