{581}{Banishment is when someone gets sent to the Void.  The Void is a bad place, I think, although no one really knows--no one has ever come back from there.  So, if you were banished it means that you were really, really bad.}{Banishment is when someone gets sent to the Void.  The Void is a bad place, I think, although no one really knows--no one has ever come back from there.  So, if you were banished it means that you were really, really bad.}{}{}{}{}
{582}{Anyone else got ba-a-n-ish-hed?}{}{-4}{}{587}{}
