{610}{That is Saint Mannox...a holy man in the church of the Panarii.  [Alexander seems to say this with pride, and a little sadness.]  He was the only man in the history of the Panarii church to ever have ascended...}{That is Saint Mannox...a holy man in the church of the Panarii.  [Alexander seems to say this with pride, and a little sadness.]  He was the only man in the history of the Panarii church to ever have ascended...}{}{}{}{ru 2063}
