{624}{[Alexander reads for a long time.  He looks up at you, anger flaring in his eyes.]  It seems we have been deceived, my friend.  The Panarii have been neglecting their duties.  That will be no longer.  I thank you.  Now I must go and right this wrong...[he looks in the direction of the high priest's chambers.]}{[Alexander reads for a long time.  He looks up at you, anger flaring in his eyes.]  It seems we have been deceived, my friend.  The Panarii have been neglecting their duties.  That will be no longer.  I thank you.  Now I must go and right this wrong...[he looks in the direction of the high priest's chambers.]}{}{}{}{ru 2066, fp}
